WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.481
How do you keep good people on your team?

2
00:00:02.853 --> 00:00:05.708
Often, with benefits they truly value.

3
00:00:06.808 --> 00:00:09.083
Group plans come in three main forms:

4
00:00:09.385 --> 00:00:12.867
a group health plan, group life and accident cover,

5
00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:14.899
and a provident fund.

6
00:00:15.999 --> 00:00:18.240
A group health plan covers your staff and,

7
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.209
if you wish, their families, often complementing GESY.

8
00:00:22.396 --> 00:00:24.996
It is one of the benefits employees value most,

9
00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.434
because they actually use it.

10
00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:32.562
Group life cover pays a sum to an employee’s family on death or disability,

11
00:00:32.656 --> 00:00:34.593
with one set of terms for everyone.

12
00:00:34.838 --> 00:00:37.589
A provident fund builds retirement savings,

13
00:00:37.613 --> 00:00:40.944
with contributions from employer and employee.

14
00:00:42.044 --> 00:00:44.946
The cost depends on the number and ages of the people,

15
00:00:45.132 --> 00:00:50.042
the level of benefits, the sector, and the claims history at renewal.

16
00:00:51.142 --> 00:00:54.044
And do not choose on the first year’s price alone.

17
00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:56.122
Explain the benefits to your staff,

18
00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:00.766
because a benefit people do not understand is one they do not value.

19
00:01:01.866 --> 00:01:04.454
See the business guide on avrastro.com,

20
00:01:04.455 --> 00:01:06.706
and book an appointment about your business.
